This port rewrites Zoomify's logic in Rust for Horizon's native mod API and is
distributed under the same licence. The zoom, scroll and transition maths
follow the original (the exponential transitions use the continuous form of
its formulas). Its config screen is Zoomify's YACL screen redrawn as YACL 3.9.7
draws it, with YACL's texts and its reset glyph; data/icon.png and the demo
pictures in data/demo are Zoomify's own (assets/zoomify).
